1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,400
An original React Three Fiber demonstration by Lex from SigmaStudioz.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:09,600
A data city: one tower per repository, grouped by team. Height is commits; shade is open issues. Synthetic, seeded sample.

3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:15,000
Selecting a tower reads its exact values. Plan view removes height from the picture.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,200
Explainer controls on a vane pump: the C key opens a cutaway, and notes label the parts inside.

5
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:24,000
Number keys move the camera between named shots. Notes follow the parts they describe.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,400
The B key rewinds to the start of the current beat. The same time always draws the same picture.

7
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:36,000
SigmaStudioz Visualizer. Interactive visuals and visualization videos. By Lex from SigmaStudioz.
